[2026-03-29 01:58:44] Replaced the verified SysTick floating-point producer with integer arithmetic.
- Updated TM4C129E_DriverLib/xApplication_MCU/Core/SYSTICK/xSource/SYSTICK_Init.c.
- Removed float32_t-based rounding in SYSTICK__enInitTickVector() that computed tick and period picoseconds.
- Added integer rounded calculations using uint64_t:
  - tick_ps = (1000000 + freq_mhz / 2) / freq_mhz
  - period_ps = (1000000 * ticks + freq_mhz / 2) / freq_mhz
- This preserves the original rounding intent while avoiding VFP operations that set FPSCR.IXC.
- Validation: VS Code diagnostics report no errors in TM4C129E_DriverLib/xApplication_MCU/Core/SYSTICK/xSource/SYSTICK_Init.c after the change.